    "text": "12 hours ago MARTINSVILLE, VA — The Harvest Foundation has awarded a total of $26,600 to three local organizations through its Project Hope initiative, supporting community-based programs across Martinsville and Henry County. The grants were announced during a celebration held October 8 at Piedmont Arts in Martinsville. The funding will support three... Read full article",
